{
  "title": "Quintessentially Gooey British Fennel Scones",
  "description": "A spicy and gooey British dish featuring fennel bulb, perfect for afternoon tea. This one-pot wonder is pressure-cooked to perfection in an agave leaf vessel.",
  "cuisine": "British",
  "diet": [
    "raw-friendly",
